                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much do Independence + Republic Day drive of revenue?</h3>
                                        <p>10-20% of Q3 + Q1 revenue for participating D2C categories. Fashion + F&B + jewelry peak higher (15-25%).</p>
                                        <h3>What CPM inflation should I expect?</h3>
                                        <p>20-40% peak week around each national day. Plan budget concentration accordingly.</p>
                                        <h3>Should international brands do Indian national day campaigns?</h3>
                                        <p>For brands with meaningful India presence: yes. Authentic patriotic content resonates when brand has genuine India commitment.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest national day marketing mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Trivial commercial exploitation without cultural respect. National symbols + flag + army references require sensitivity.</p>
